/ActualText (Airbnb is a global online marketplace that connects hosts offering accommodations with guests seeking short-term lodging experiences. Founded in 2008, Airbnb has revolutionized the travel and hospitality industry by allowing individuals to rent out their homes, apartments, or unique spaces. The platform facilitates transactions, provides secure payment options, and enables both hosts and guests to rate and review each other.)
